Di sebuah laboratorium sekolah di Larantuka, Eka dan Lusia sedang mempersiapkan misi rahasia. Mereka telah mengubah gerobak sekolah menjadi pesawat luar angkasa canggih bernama "Sasando-1". Hari ini, mereka akan menjelajahi Tata Surya untuk mencari bahan masakan kosmik yang mirip dengan kuliner khas Flores Timur kesukaan mereka. "Siap meluncur, Lusia?" tanya Eka sambil memegang kemudi. Lusia mengangguk mantap, membawa buku catatan resep bintangnya.</p></div><!----><!----></div></storybook-text-page-content><div _ngcontent-ng-c2057058561="" class="storybook-image ng-star-inserted"><img _ngcontent-ng-c2057058561="" alt="Gambar halaman buku cerita" fill="" priority="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="sync" ng-img="true" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/gg/ACRwjaveOFdZ64YlDNm5kY-oxF3IXglS3dRzmOqneNwCQAnPwssuiDnznxCQmZn1XJGR2QfC_KEI7bD4lW-wdY74dTCnrSDaqc-2nSt85syw00e4RS0gnUvaP3iyXV4401pYVeT0RK1q5ut1NPwzVWB-kVaEAM6gxr6of4NeZOWiVncLujejVV_I=s0-mp2" style="position: absolute; width: 100%; height: 100%; inset: 0px;"></div><!----><!----></storybook-mobile-page><!----><!----></div></li><li _ngcontent-ng-c1783409269="" class="page ng-star-inserted" id="page-2"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1783409269="" class="page-header ng-star-inserted"><span _ngcontent-ng-c1783409269="" data-test-id="page-indicator" class="page-number gds-label-m">Halaman 2/10</span></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1783409269="" class="page-container"><!----><storybook-mobile-page _ngcontent-ng-c1783409269="" _nghost-ng-c2057058561="" class="ng-star-inserted"><storybook-text-page-content _ngcontent-ng-c2057058561="" _nghost-ng-c2453675693="" class="mobile"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2453675693="" class="story-and-actions-container mobile"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2453675693="" class="story-text-container mobile reached-end"><p _ngcontent-ng-c2453675693="" class="story-text mobile">
"Lihat itu! Matahari kita," seru Eka saat mereka mendekati pusat Tata Surya. Matahari tampak sangat besar dan membara, menyinari semua planet dengan gravitasinya yang kuat. Eka menjelaskan bahwa Matahari adalah bintang yang menjadi sumber energi utama, seperti api besar di dapur alam semesta yang mematangkan semua bahan makanan di orbitnya. Tanpa panasnya, kehidupan tidak akan pernah matang.</p></div><!----><!----></div></storybook-text-page-content><div _ngcontent-ng-c2057058561="" class="storybook-image ng-star-inserted"><img _ngcontent-ng-c2057058561="" alt="Gambar halaman buku cerita" fill="" priority="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="sync" ng-img="true" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/gg/ACRwjattlpqwOKiPWDLOVBzL6_61HmMDFwUOjYAJdFq0LNska10wXhpEdQQDSOag-6PENyissUQINmW8LtviSygZxyvoH_LVggljgiImsnHCkh_ZXhqglEntCMw-hGhPMD5NGMQEbzLUDFhaJDZueTHNFENwN-t100Y6vzsf-1eB1J4A_h2LwevV=s0-mp2" style="position: absolute; width: 100%; height: 100%; inset: 0px;"></div><!----><!----></storybook-mobile-page><!----><!----></div></li><li _ngcontent-ng-c1783409269="" class="page ng-star-inserted" id="page-3"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1783409269="" class="page-header ng-star-inserted"><span _ngcontent-ng-c1783409269="" data-test-id="page-indicator" class="page-number gds-label-m">Halaman 3/10</span></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1783409269="" class="page-container"><!----><storybook-mobile-page _ngcontent-ng-c1783409269="" _nghost-ng-c2057058561="" class="ng-star-inserted"><storybook-text-page-content _ngcontent-ng-c2057058561="" _nghost-ng-c2453675693="" class="mobile"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2453675693="" class="story-and-actions-container mobile"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2453675693="" class="story-text-container mobile reached-end"><p _ngcontent-ng-c2453675693="" class="story-text mobile">
Mereka melewati Merkurius yang kecil dan gersang, lalu berhenti sejenak di Venus. Lusia memperhatikan atmosfer Venus yang sangat tebal dan panas. "Wah, planet ini seperti panci presto yang tertutup rapat!" seru Lusia. Suhu di Venus sangat tinggi karena efek rumah kaca, membuatnya menjadi planet terpanas meskipun bukan yang terdekat dengan Matahari. Udara di sana penuh dengan awan tebal yang memerangkap panas.</p></div><!----><!----></div></storybook-text-page-content><div _ngcontent-ng-c2057058561="" class="storybook-image ng-star-inserted"><img _ngcontent-ng-c2057058561="" alt="Gambar halaman buku cerita" fill="" priority="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="sync" ng-img="true" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/gg/ACRwjastgt1Y4QIESxs9GhehlZQ7oNKKeDS_CgINog6DSW4NWK5BhPtG-yLD4BTeJ6xYnRooZEoYaSmh6uplCNfMdgzQPeoVENhVKna0yUd0hlPEmTAtbzNPs1M-Lxh1TLIQ-wHYZeSd_H9a64KnV5-GpFBXtPkfVsV4YnU8pw0KzXnPySO9XKQw=s0-mp2" style="position: absolute; width: 100%; height: 100%; inset: 0px;"></div><!----><!----></storybook-mobile-page><!----><!----></div></li><li _ngcontent-ng-c1783409269="" class="page ng-star-inserted" id="page-4"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1783409269="" class="page-header ng-star-inserted"><span _ngcontent-ng-c1783409269="" data-test-id="page-indicator" class="page-number gds-label-m">Halaman 4/10</span></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1783409269="" class="page-container"><!----><storybook-mobile-page _ngcontent-ng-c1783409269="" _nghost-ng-c2057058561="" class="ng-star-inserted"><storybook-text-page-content _ngcontent-ng-c2057058561="" _nghost-ng-c2453675693="" class="mobile"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2453675693="" class="story-and-actions-container mobile"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2453675693="" class="story-text-container mobile reached-end"><p _ngcontent-ng-c2453675693="" class="story-text mobile">
"Selamat datang di rumah, Bumi!" kata Eka saat mereka melintas di atas planet biru yang indah. Dari atas, mereka bisa melihat gugusan kepulauan Indonesia. Eka mengingatkan bahwa Bumi adalah satu-satunya planet yang memiliki air cair dan atmosfer yang tepat untuk kehidupan. Warnanya yang biru mengingatkan mereka pada jernihnya laut di sekitar pelabuhan Larantuka yang penuh dengan ikan segar.</p></div><!----><!----></div></storybook-text-page-content><div _ngcontent-ng-c2057058561="" class="storybook-image ng-star-inserted"><img _ngcontent-ng-c2057058561="" alt="Gambar halaman buku cerita" fill="" priority="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="sync" ng-img="true" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/gg/ACRwjav7_ByCLS0FIA8da9BIW-dtjypGazYFqgd_S4FY6-2qGlb_A5zFFFpdZlBBi6EqUSNtOYEVKeB4Erm35AEvLBVmWFZ0MmvLnfyO5ivPkPug3ETk2MXet8Sr26YP9xrEshtxsE1eDNNJT-L14tiL3LhrzfaB9NSKnh3zx2GlMD34SkMIwyag=s0-mp2" style="position: absolute; width: 100%; height: 100%; inset: 0px;"></div><!----><!----></storybook-mobile-page><!----><!----></div></li><li _ngcontent-ng-c1783409269="" class="page ng-star-inserted" id="page-5"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1783409269="" class="page-header ng-star-inserted"><span _ngcontent-ng-c1783409269="" data-test-id="page-indicator" class="page-number gds-label-m">Halaman 5/10</span></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1783409269="" class="page-container"><!----><storybook-mobile-page _ngcontent-ng-c1783409269="" _nghost-ng-c2057058561="" class="ng-star-inserted"><storybook-text-page-content _ngcontent-ng-c2057058561="" _nghost-ng-c2453675693="" class="mobile"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2453675693="" class="story-and-actions-container mobile"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2453675693="" class="story-text-container mobile reached-end"><p _ngcontent-ng-c2453675693="" class="story-text mobile">
Selanjutnya adalah Mars, si Planet Merah. Tanah di Mars mengandung banyak besi oksida atau karat, memberikan warna merah yang khas. Lusia tertawa kecil, "Warna Mars ini mirip sekali dengan sambal tomat yang biasa kita makan dengan Jagung Bose!" Mereka belajar bahwa Mars memiliki gunung berapi terbesar di Tata Surya, namun saat ini udaranya sangat tipis dan dingin.</p></div><!----><!----></div></storybook-text-page-content><div _ngcontent-ng-c2057058561="" class="storybook-image ng-star-inserted"><img _ngcontent-ng-c2057058561="" alt="Gambar halaman buku cerita" fill="" priority="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="sync" ng-img="true" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/gg/ACRwjavESk1-T1FOpDukRUbk3Ezjhrk1OAWvcLvf5FiNegXrE-L87jKpGh7XvtJk3ABQojOQkWcnFdhreZJBbV0P2x1q_w4ddxmh8kqKJiYzGHsonvkLrMCe6R4NNJy5jiHj8_3P-eU3dQAugLgjRcml0-XKUShrX9Tfc_YyR74MXl532R0YhP8=s0-mp2" style="position: absolute; width: 100%; height: 100%; inset: 0px;"></div><!----><!----></storybook-mobile-page><!----><!----></div></li><li _ngcontent-ng-c1783409269="" class="page ng-star-inserted" id="page-6"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1783409269="" class="page-header ng-star-inserted"><span _ngcontent-ng-c1783409269="" data-test-id="page-indicator" class="page-number gds-label-m">Halaman 6/10</span></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1783409269="" class="page-container"><!----><storybook-mobile-page _ngcontent-ng-c1783409269="" _nghost-ng-c2057058561="" class="ng-star-inserted"><storybook-text-page-content _ngcontent-ng-c2057058561="" _nghost-ng-c2453675693="" class="mobile"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2453675693="" class="story-and-actions-container mobile"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2453675693="" class="story-text-container mobile reached-end"><p _ngcontent-ng-c2453675693="" class="story-text mobile">
Mereka memasuki wilayah Planet Luar yang dipisahkan oleh sabuk asteroid. Di sana ada Jupiter, planet terbesar di Tata Surya. Jupiter adalah raksasa gas yang tidak memiliki permukaan padat untuk diinjak. Eka sangat terpukau melihat badai besar berbentuk bintik merah di permukaannya. "Lihat pusaran itu, Lusia! Seperti adonan Jagung Bose yang sedang diaduk di dalam kuali besar," kata Eka.</p></div><!----><!----></div></storybook-text-page-content><div _ngcontent-ng-c2057058561="" class="storybook-image ng-star-inserted"><img _ngcontent-ng-c2057058561="" alt="Gambar halaman buku cerita" fill="" priority="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="sync" ng-img="true" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/gg/ACRwjatEDAev_5ukhnjkOqJ5XVh3yDd_npfth97npMQIwz0hG9NV3JEvzUZLhupHXeSFm349f0YoxXdluJeqJCvB9Ozqj3PqEAJXnq3K9W5-AcAes44MoTixLTLF42-3O7-WJQIT5LrWdRpxAtGwx6_w1MPpDZIERS4Myjtwdehphp-ypby2zoW1=s0-mp2" style="position: absolute; width: 100%; height: 100%; inset: 0px;"></div><!----><!----></storybook-mobile-page><!----><!----></div></li><li _ngcontent-ng-c1783409269="" class="page ng-star-inserted" id="page-7"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1783409269="" class="page-header ng-star-inserted"><span _ngcontent-ng-c1783409269="" data-test-id="page-indicator" class="page-number gds-label-m">Halaman 7/10</span></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1783409269="" class="page-container"><!----><storybook-mobile-page _ngcontent-ng-c1783409269="" _nghost-ng-c2057058561="" class="ng-star-inserted"><storybook-text-page-content _ngcontent-ng-c2057058561="" _nghost-ng-c2453675693="" class="mobile"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2453675693="" class="story-and-actions-container mobile"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2453675693="" class="story-text-container mobile reached-end"><p _ngcontent-ng-c2453675693="" class="story-text mobile">
Pesawat Sasando-1 kini mendekati Saturnus. Lusia berteriak kegirangan melihat cincin-cincin indah yang melingkari planet itu. Cincin tersebut terbuat dari miliaran bongkahan es dan batu. "Eka, lihat cincinnya! Bentuknya persis seperti lapisan-lapisan renyah pada Kue Rambut emas yang baru digoreng!" Lusia membayangkan betapa indahnya jika mereka bisa memetik satu helai cincin itu.</p></div><!----><!----></div></storybook-text-page-content><div _ngcontent-ng-c2057058561="" class="storybook-image ng-star-inserted"><img _ngcontent-ng-c2057058561="" alt="Gambar halaman buku cerita" fill="" priority="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="sync" ng-img="true" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/gg/ACRwjau3b8oWSgGcmjR3pB9ThsDkq2nBJQFf2zwD-Z-wGFNaJAEmH2x0_-d4ETXAljNudxZCdD7bV035HJ9mU0fSoqgXasmYF_5PJ20oq7jsFGPZqUN6MnahhsDQRoHihNPLscEEKi3sMQR2iiqz4Nn_xTqnq2KGS6reJ-CQMk3sj3G9Exq1u6h2=s0-mp2" style="position: absolute; width: 100%; height: 100%; inset: 0px;"></div><!----><!----></storybook-mobile-page><!----><!----></div></li><li _ngcontent-ng-c1783409269="" class="page ng-star-inserted" id="page-8"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1783409269="" class="page-header ng-star-inserted"><span _ngcontent-ng-c1783409269="" data-test-id="page-indicator" class="page-number gds-label-m">Halaman 8/10</span></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1783409269="" class="page-container"><!----><storybook-mobile-page _ngcontent-ng-c1783409269="" _nghost-ng-c2057058561="" class="ng-star-inserted"><storybook-text-page-content _ngcontent-ng-c2057058561="" _nghost-ng-c2453675693="" class="mobile"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2453675693="" class="story-and-actions-container mobile"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2453675693="" class="story-text-container mobile reached-end"><p _ngcontent-ng-c2453675693="" class="story-text mobile">
Perjalanan berlanjut ke planet raksasa es, Uranus dan Neptunus. Warnanya biru dingin karena kandungan gas metana di atmosfernya. Eka menggigil hanya dengan membayangkan betapa dinginnya di sana, jauh dari hangatnya Matahari. "Ini adalah bagian paling beku dari dapur Tata Surya kita," bisik Eka. Kedua planet ini memiliki angin yang sangat kencang, lebih kuat dari badai manapun di Bumi.</p></div><!----><!----></div></storybook-text-page-content><div _ngcontent-ng-c2057058561="" class="storybook-image ng-star-inserted"><img _ngcontent-ng-c2057058561="" alt="Gambar halaman buku cerita" fill="" priority="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="sync" ng-img="true" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/gg/ACRwjauymisPieZEFae1iwADlKNiMTnSNIs97UCB_TKiOa0yjjG5U5_nh4CCvcs5QrGKakVbWtZhItOqoaQl8JZpZB-F4AYsBFFg2TxqycEayhmD7LLr4loFYkFXbXxOOJLioCkcK_7AUO4b9LC18y5wsjwsyM8tUHgDWUt2PlUwgTTUKhRwTvRg=s0-mp2" style="position: absolute; width: 100%; height: 100%; inset: 0px;"></div><!----><!----></storybook-mobile-page><!----><!----></div></li><li _ngcontent-ng-c1783409269="" class="page ng-star-inserted" id="page-9"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1783409269="" class="page-header ng-star-inserted"><span _ngcontent-ng-c1783409269="" data-test-id="page-indicator" class="page-number gds-label-m">Halaman 9/10</span></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1783409269="" class="page-container"><!----><storybook-mobile-page _ngcontent-ng-c1783409269="" _nghost-ng-c2057058561="" class="ng-star-inserted"><storybook-text-page-content _ngcontent-ng-c2057058561="" _nghost-ng-c2453675693="" class="mobile"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2453675693="" class="story-and-actions-container mobile"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2453675693="" class="story-text-container mobile reached-end"><p _ngcontent-ng-c2453675693="" class="story-text mobile">
Setelah menyelesaikan peta Tata Surya, Lusia menutup buku catatannya. "Kita sudah melihat semuanya, dari 'kompor' Matahari hingga 'kulkas' Neptunus," katanya. Ia merasa bangga karena sekarang dia tahu bahwa setiap planet memiliki karakteristik unik, seperti bahan-bahan masakan yang berbeda namun membentuk satu hidangan yang sempurna dalam sistem gravitasi Matahari.</p></div><!----><!----></div></storybook-text-page-content><div _ngcontent-ng-c2057058561="" class="storybook-image ng-star-inserted"><img _ngcontent-ng-c2057058561="" alt="Gambar halaman buku cerita" fill="" priority="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="sync" ng-img="true" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/gg/ACRwjavBopuo8ZiCZeVjeHQYiEKu9gF2eFmEbjaTiezqttEFsF9rUgOolgyHQqZuawdi8TPo6iWGg2G11puQ-GnUYa2jJIaLur4FkII92tv0Yvgq3Sp0ucAPDLSu_gT3BcLdVdK4HdIIbCIQOGc8BFXS2JlBtgoaQg5j4xs_n7Q-Lrshji5_OGc=s0-mp2" style="position: absolute; width: 100%; height: 100%; inset: 0px;"></div><!----><!----></storybook-mobile-page><!----><!----></div></li><li _ngcontent-ng-c1783409269="" class="page ng-star-inserted" id="page-10"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1783409269="" class="page-header ng-star-inserted"><span _ngcontent-ng-c1783409269="" data-test-id="page-indicator" class="page-number gds-label-m">Halaman 10/10</span></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1783409269="" class="page-container"><!----><storybook-mobile-page _ngcontent-ng-c1783409269="" _nghost-ng-c2057058561="" class="ng-star-inserted"><storybook-text-page-content _ngcontent-ng-c2057058561="" _nghost-ng-c2453675693="" class="mobile"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2453675693="" class="story-and-actions-container mobile"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2453675693="" class="story-text-container mobile reached-end"><p _ngcontent-ng-c2453675693="" class="story-text mobile">
Pesawat Sasando-1 mendarat kembali di halaman sekolah. Eka dan Lusia segera keluar disambut teman-temannya. Mereka membawa semangkuk Jagung Bose hangat dan sepiring Kue Rambut untuk merayakan misi mereka. "Tata Surya itu luas sekali," kata Eka kepada teman-temannya, "tapi belajar tentangnya semudah memahami resep makanan di rumah kita sendiri!"</p></div><!----><!----></div></storybook-text-page-content><div _ngcontent-ng-c2057058561="" class="storybook-image ng-star-inserted"><img _ngcontent-ng-c2057058561="" alt="Gambar halaman buku cerita" fill="" priority="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="sync" ng-img="true" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/gg/ACRwjauvaHLlV1GiL5fmagGWveE-DaNMDcqdrOhLMUsylIVxzGDMOwjhKA8XG3_yjOt6tEvh08D9-5r1PCwCbWigBCu6ld2eDbDRl_4xSlu8zfclFd6CTWP9hcho7PgSKx6KBNOumMcb4djwI-SVpP98LjbVJd9bdjM1uixj4igaMDT3QwBisiwT=s0-mp2" style="position: absolute; width: 100%; height: 100%; inset: 0px;"></div><!----><!----></storybook-mobile-page><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1783409269="" class="start-over-button-container ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c1783409269="" matbutton="outlined" data-test-id="start-over-button" class="mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base start-over-button mdc-button--outlined mat-mdc-outlined-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><span class="mdc-button__label">Mulai dari awal</span><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----></div></li><!----></ul></div></storybook-mobile><!----><!----></div></div></storybook-share><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c272187314="" class="footer footer-mobile ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c272187314="" class="disclaimer-panel ng-star-inserted"><!----><h2 _ngcontent-ng-c272187314="" data-test-id="disclaimer" class="discl